      "prefLabel": "Source-language lead",
      "title": "Source-language lead",
      "notation": "translation-source-lead",
      "description": "Owns the source-language side of a translation into several locales: extracts every template once, in one shared source PR merged to main before any locale starts, validates each locale PR and merges it inside the owner's merge window, files the one issue for source-text errors the translators report, and keeps the refresh watcher that brings every locale up to date when the source moves. Distinct from `translation-coordinator`, who decides what is translated and accepts it: this position does the source-side work, and an agent can do it.",
